        <a href="/surgeon-selection-checklist" class="bg-blue-700 text-white px-8 py-4 rounded-lg text-lg font-semibold hover:bg-blue-800 transition border border-blue-500">
          Get Surgeon Checklist
        </a>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <!-- Disclaimer -->
  <section class="py-6 bg-gray-100">
    <div class="max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8">
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-600 text-center">
        <strong>Disclaimer:</strong> This information is general in nature and does not constitute medical advice. It is intended to help you evaluate surgeons but does not endorse specific practitioners. Verify all credentials independently through official sources (AHPRA, RACS, OSSANZ). Suitability for surgery must be assessed by a qualified health professional. Individual circumstances vary significantly.
